      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIGER TIE (1) hit the frame two starts ago at Eagle Farm but ran below par last time when finishing midfield over the 1000m at Eagle Farm after being in the firing line on the turn. Drawn to advantage on the inside and gets an important 2kg claim. Is sure to take some running down.  DANCE GAVIN DANCE (5) made it back-to-back wins when successful last start at Grafton when again finishing over the top of them. Winning hoop Peisley pilots again and only needs to hold form to be fighting it out. POSEIDON'S SON (2) is a noted winner resuming for the Dunn camp. Strips fitter for three trials and gets some help at the weights with the claimer engaged. Will race handy and be there to take a strong account. LADY WARDELL (4) booted up from the inside draw to race on the speed only to be claimed late and finish fourth last start at Murwillumbah. Peaking now and can give this a shake.",
